{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644100/extras/f2236666fbb9206e9e257628b42c2029.avif?t=1759356701\" data-has-big width=800 height=284 /></span><strong>In this point and click adventure</strong> join Nora on her journey of weird and wonderful discovery. Uncover secrets and discover the truth to bring the residents of her town back home. With a note instructing her to go somewhere forbidden as her only hope. She now must explore what remains of Gruesome Grove and beyond to get to the bottom of the mystery. Why did monsters steal the residents and where did they come from?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world she's known is about to be changed forever. She\u2019s going to have to break the rules to save everyone she loves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644100/extras/97dee0d62b342c82879589ee0bd34f7a.avif?t=1759356701\" data-has-big width=800 height=97 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644100/extras/d8b1d074db78627d0194052d61e8ced4.poster.avif?t=1759356701\" width=800 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644100/extras/d8b1d074db78627d0194052d61e8ced4.webm?t=1759356701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644100/extras/d8b1d074db78627d0194052d61e8ced4.mp4?t=1759356701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644100/extras/5c84b71e5ed6a14f626992e8a32d4e4e.avif?t=17593567